@startuml Diagramme de Composants - Architecture Minimale + Outbox Pattern
title Architecture Minimale (MVP + Outbox Pattern)\nTransfert + Settlement + Garantie Exactly-Once\nDiagramme de Composants

!define FONTCOLOR_COMP #333333
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
    BorderColor #388E3C
    ArrowColor #388E3C
}
skinparam interface {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #388E3C
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F57F17
}

' ============================================================
' CLIENT LAYER
' ============================================================

package "👥 Client Layer" {
    component [REST Client\n(curl/postman)] as RestClient
}

' ============================================================
' API GATEWAY
' ============================================================

package "🚪 API Gateway" {
    component [KrakenD\n:8080\n(JWT + Rate limit + CORS)] as KrakenD
}

' ============================================================
' CONFIGURATION (Hardcoded Aliases)
' ============================================================

package "⚙️ Configuration & Aliases" {
    component [application.yaml\n(Hardcoded Aliases)] as AliasConfig
    component [AliasRegistry\n(In-Memory Map)] as AliasRegistry
}

' ============================================================
' PAYMENT ORCHESTRATION :8083
' ============================================================

package "💳 Payment Orchestration :8083" {
    component [Payment REST API\n(Spring Boot 3)] as PaymentAPI
    component [Kafka Consumer\n(Saga Choreographer)] as SagaConsumer
    component [Idempotency Cache\n(Redis TTL 24h)] as IdempotencyCache
    component [Payment Repository\n(JPA/Hibernate)] as PaymentRepo

    package "📤 Outbox Pattern" {
        database [payment_outbox_event\n(published=false)] as PaymentOutboxTable
        component [PaymentOutboxPublisher\n@Scheduled 500ms] as PaymentPoller
    }

    database [db_payment\n(MySQL 8.4)] as DB_Payment
}

' ============================================================
' CLEARING SETTLEMENT :8084
' ============================================================

package "🏛️ Clearing & Settlement :8084" {
    component [Kafka Consumer\n(settlement_triggered listener)] as ClearingConsumer
    component [Settlement Service\n(double-entry validator)] as SettlementService
    component [Ledger Repository\n(append-only)] as LedgerRepo

    package "📤 Outbox Pattern" {
        database [settlement_outbox_event\n(published=false)] as ClearingOutboxTable
        component [ClearingOutboxPublisher\n@Scheduled 500ms] as ClearingPoller
    }

    database [db_clearing\n(MySQL 8.4)\nledger_entry (immutable)] as DB_Clearing
}

' ============================================================
' MESSAGE BROKER
' ============================================================

package "📡 Kafka Broker" {
    component [payment.initiated] as T1
    component [payment.debit_requested] as T2
    component [payment.credit_requested] as T3
    component [payment.settlement_triggered] as T4
    component [payment.settled] as T5
    component [clearing.settlement_confirmed] as T6
}

' ============================================================
' OBSERVABILITY
' ============================================================

package "📊 Observability" {
    component [Prometheus] as Prometheus
    component [Grafana] as Grafana
}

' ============================================================
' SHARED INFRASTRUCTURE
' ============================================================

package "🛠️ Infrastructure" {
    database [Redis\n(Idempotency cache)] as Redis
    component [Docker Compose] as DockerCompose
}

' ============================================================
' RELATIONSHIPS - DATA FLOW
' ============================================================

RestClient --> KrakenD : HTTP/REST
KrakenD --> PaymentAPI : route /api/payment/**

AliasConfig --> AliasRegistry : charge au démarrage
PaymentAPI --> AliasRegistry : resolve(alias)
PaymentAPI --> IdempotencyCache : lookup / store
IdempotencyCache --> Redis : GET/SET

' Outbox write path (atomic)
PaymentAPI --> PaymentRepo : INSERT payment (tx)
PaymentAPI --> PaymentOutboxTable : INSERT outbox_event (même tx)
PaymentRepo --> DB_Payment
PaymentOutboxTable --> DB_Payment

' Outbox poll & publish
PaymentPoller --> PaymentOutboxTable : SELECT WHERE published=false
PaymentPoller --> T1 : send payment.initiated
PaymentPoller --> T2 : send payment.debit_requested
PaymentPoller --> T3 : send payment.credit_requested
PaymentPoller --> T4 : send payment.settlement_triggered
PaymentPoller --> T5 : send payment.settled
PaymentPoller --> PaymentOutboxTable : UPDATE published=true

' Saga consumer
SagaConsumer --> T1 : consumes
SagaConsumer --> T2 : consumes
SagaConsumer --> T3 : consumes
SagaConsumer --> T6 : consumes (→ SETTLED)
SagaConsumer --> PaymentRepo : UPDATE status
SagaConsumer --> PaymentOutboxTable : INSERT next outbox event

' Clearing write path (atomic)
ClearingConsumer --> T4 : consumes
ClearingConsumer --> SettlementService : record entries
SettlementService --> LedgerRepo : INSERT entry(DEBIT) + entry(CREDIT)
SettlementService --> ClearingOutboxTable : INSERT outbox_event (même tx)
LedgerRepo --> DB_Clearing
ClearingOutboxTable --> DB_Clearing

' Clearing outbox poll & publish
ClearingPoller --> ClearingOutboxTable : SELECT WHERE published=false
ClearingPoller --> T6 : send clearing.settlement_confirmed
ClearingPoller --> ClearingOutboxTable : UPDATE published=true

' Observability
PaymentAPI --> Prometheus : /actuator/prometheus
ClearingConsumer --> Prometheus : /actuator/prometheus
Prometheus --> Grafana : scrape

DockerCompose ..|> KrakenD : manages
DockerCompose ..|> PaymentAPI : manages
DockerCompose ..|> ClearingConsumer : manages
DockerCompose ..|> Kafka : manages
DockerCompose ..|> Redis : manages
DockerCompose ..|> Prometheus : manages
DockerCompose ..|> Grafana : manages

' ============================================================
' NOTES
' ============================================================

note right of AliasRegistry
  **Hardcoded Aliases:**
  ✗ Pas de service alias
  ✗ Pas de DB
  ✗ Pas de YAML
  ✓ Map<String,AliasEntry> dans
    AliasRegistry.java
  ✓ Chargée au démarrage (@PostConstruct)
end note

note right of PaymentOutboxTable
  **Outbox Pattern (Payment):**
  Garantit atomicité entre
  écriture DB et Kafka:
  1. Payment + OutboxEvent
     → même transaction JPA
  2. @Scheduled poll 500ms
     → kafkaTemplate.send()
  3. published = true
  Pas de perte d'événement
  même si Kafka est down
end note

note right of ClearingOutboxTable
  **Outbox Pattern (Clearing):**
  1. LedgerEntry(×2) + OutboxEvent
     → même transaction JPA
  2. @Scheduled poll 500ms
     → publie settlement_confirmed
  3. published = true
end note

note right of DB_Clearing
  **Ledger Immuable:**
  • Append-only (pas de UPDATE)
  • UNIQUE(payment_id, direction)
  • SHA256 hash par entrée
  • SQL trigger anti-mutation
  • DEBIT = CREDIT validé
end note

note bottom of T4
  **Topics Kafka (6 total):**
  payment.initiated
  payment.debit_requested
  payment.credit_requested
  payment.settlement_triggered
  payment.settled
  clearing.settlement_confirmed
  
  Partitionné par paymentId
  → ordering garanti par paiement
end note

note bottom of DockerCompose
  **Saga Chorégraphiée — Règles:**
  ✓ Aucun appel REST entre services
  ✓ Communication uniquement via Kafka
  ✓ Chaque service réagit aux events
     de façon autonome
  ✓ Outbox garantit at-least-once
  ✓ Idempotency garantit exactly-once
  ✗ Pas d'Alias Service
end note

@enduml
